# Trivy ignore entries — every exception needs a justification.
# Prefer fixing findings over ignoring them.
# IDs: https://avd.aquasec.com/misconfig/

# Intentional internet-facing Application Load Balancer (public edge for the app).
AVD-AWS-0053

# HTTP :80 listener is required for ACM HTTP→HTTPS redirect (and HTTP-only demo when
# certificate_arn is unset). HTTPS listener uses TLS 1.3 when a cert is provided.
AVD-AWS-0054

# EKS control-plane and node SGs must allow egress 0.0.0.0/0 so nodes can pull images
# and call AWS APIs via NAT. Ingress remains least-privilege (no SSH from the world).
AVD-AWS-0104
